#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.rst:2
msgid "Visualization"
msgstr "Visualization"

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization:1
msgid "Module contenant les fonctions de visualisation."
msgstr "Module containing visualization functions."

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:1
msgid "Normalisation des données avec prise en compte de l'ordre de grandeur et adaptation des plages."
msgstr "Data normalization that accounts for order of magnitude and range adjustment."

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:3
msgid "Règles :"
msgstr "Rules:"

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:4
msgid "Si toutes les valeurs sont dans `[0,1]`, normalisation vers `[0, SCALE]`."
msgstr "If all values are in `[0,1]`, normalize to `[0, SCALE]`."

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:5
msgid "Si valeurs négatives et positives, on prend la puissance de 2 la plus proche de ``max(abs(min), abs(max))`` et on transpose vers `[0, SCALE]`."
msgstr "If there are both negative and positive values, take the power of 2 closest to ``max(abs(min), abs(max)) `` and transpose to `[0, SCALE]`."

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:6
msgid "Colonne uniforme : on force une valeur constante de ``SCALE``."
msgstr "Uniform column: force a constant value of ``SCALE``."

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:7
msgid "Si toutes les valeurs sont positives, on considère 0 comme min et on normalise avec la puissance de 2 la plus proche du max."
msgstr "If all values are positive, treat 0 as the minimum and normalize using the power of 2 closest to the maximum."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.rst
msgid "Paramètres"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:9
msgid "Données à normaliser."
msgstr "Data to be normalized."

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:10
msgid "Échelle de normalisation."
msgstr "Normalization scale."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.rst
msgid "Renvoie"
msgstr "Returns"

#: of palm_tracer.Processing.Visualization.normalize_data:11
msgid "Données normalisées."
msgstr "Normalized data."

